 seven bolte hain, toh saat hi hota hai"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, seven ka numeral 7 hai, aur Hindi mein saat. Ab nau ka numeral kya hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"nau toh 9 hota hai, nine bhi bolte hain"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, nau ka numeral 9 hai, aur English mein nine. Ab cricket mein socho: koi batsman ek bhi run bina banaye out ho gaya. Uska score kya hoga?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm… score 0 hoga… kyunki ek bhi run nahi bana, toh kuch nahi… zero"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, score zero hai, kyunki ek bhi run nahi bana. Zero bhi ek number hai. Jab score zero ho, use number likhna kyun zaroori hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm… zero batata hai ki kuch nahi hai… jaise plate mein kuch nahi hai toh zero roti… kyunki zero ka matlab kuch bhi nahi"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, zero batata hai ki ek bhi roti nahi bachi. Plate wala example bilkul sahi hai. Ab do rotiyaan kha lo, toh kitni bachengi?"},{"who":"child","text":"0… kyunki dono kha li na, toh kuch nahi bacha."},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, zero roti bachi, kyunki dono kha li. Ab ulta gino: teen, do, ek. Uske baad kya aayega?"},{"who":"child","text":"0. teen, do, ek, uske baad zero aata hai. kyunki ek se kam kuch nahi hota, toh zero."},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, ek ke baad ulta ginte hue zero aata hai. Ab 6 aur 9 thode ek jaise dikhte hain. Inmein fark kya hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"6 ka neeche wala hissa gol hai, 9 ka upar wala hissa gol hai. jaise 6 baitha hua hai, 9 khada hai."},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, tumne gol hissa sahi pehchana: 6 mein neeche, 9 mein upar. Ab Bholu ne 6 ulta likha aur bola ki woh ab bhi chhah hai. Kya Bholu sahi hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"nahi... 6 ulta likhne se 9 ban jaata hai, chhah nahi rehta"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Bilkul, ulta chhah nau ban jaata hai. Ab maan lo taar pe teen chidiyaan hain. Teeno udd jaayein, toh taar pe kitni bachengi?"},{"who":"child","text":"0… zero… kyunki teeno udd gayi na… taar pe kuch nahi bacha"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, zero chidiyaan bachi, kyunki teeno udd gayi. Ab main eight bolti hoon. Tum ungliyon se eight dikhaoge?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... haath kholo, ek, do, teen, chaar, paanch... phir doosre haath se teen... teen ungliyan... toh paanch aur teen, aath ungliyan"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, tumne paanch aur teen ungliyan gin kar aath bataya. Ab batao, aath ko numeral mein kaise dikhate hain?"},{"who":"child","text":"paanch aur teen… jaise maine kiya na abhi?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, tumne paanch aur teen ungliyan dikhayi thi. Woh aath ungliyan hain. Aath ka likha hua numeral 8 hota hai."}],"usage":{"usd":0.0679,"tokens":52308},"boards":8,"lastMs":3137,"screen":{"on":"board","texts":["8"],"words":"the board shows writing; written on it: 8"},"learner":{"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s1":{"read":"partly","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i01","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i09","kind":"near_transfer"}],"grades":["correct","correct"],"claimed":"understood","evidence":"Four claps right; seven-clap transfer with reason right"},"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s2":{"read":"partly","depth":"untested","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i02","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i11","kind":"retrieval"}],"grades":["correct","correct"],"evidence":"Eight fingers correct; numeral answer not given"},"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s3":{"read":"partly","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i06","kind":"error_spot"}],"grades":["correct"],"evidence":"Reversal contrast right; another right answer needed"},"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s4":{"read":"understood","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i10","kind":"far_transfer"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i04","kind":"why"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i03","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i13","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i07","kind":"predict"}],"grades":["correct","correc